      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/25/multimedia/25parade-live-marching-band-gfqm/25parade-live-marching-band-gfqm-mediumSquareAt3X.jpg" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;margin-bottom:10px;" alt="Macy’s Thanksgiving Day Parade Upends Plans and Adds Costs for Marching Bands" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nine marching bands were set to perform in the Macy’s Thanksgiving Day Parade. The decision to move the event to Saturday posed new logistical challenges for them.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
